{
  "action": "In general, a standard system update will make all the necessary changes.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-40253",
    "CVE-2026-23893"
  ],
  "description": "It was discovered that primitive decoders in openCryptoki produced integer\nunderflows when the encoded length was zero. An attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to trigger out-of-bounds reads. (CVE-2026-40253)\n\nIt was discovered that openCryptoki incorrectly handled symlinks. An\nattacker in the token-group could possibly use this issue to achieve\nprivilege  escalation or access sensitive information. (CVE-2026-23893)",
  "id": "USN-8686-1",
  "isummary": "Several security issues were fixed in openCryptoki.",
